      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THIRTEENTH MAN (4) did a great job to score by 2 lengths over this course and distance last time out to continue his outstanding recent form. Racing high on confidence of late and there's no reason why he cannot salute again. SHOALWATER BAY (2) was out of the money two runs back then just missed the frame last start over 1560m at Mackay, beaten 0.8 lengths into fourth after being in contention on the bend. Has the talent to take care of this field. HI FRANK (7) finished just out of the money two starts back then was beaten 3 lengths when fourth over 1400m at Tambo two weeks ago. Meeting a deeper field this time but he cannot be taken lightly. BUGDEN (6) finished out of the money when eighth in a 1500m contest at Warwick a week-and-a-half ago. This doesn't look as hard so he is set to turn things around.",
